      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso, right side",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>Details of what is charged against the dyed silk:</li>\n<li>Original cost: raw silk, 66 ra\u1e6dls &mdash; price: 300 dinars</li>\n<li>Expenses and sundries charged to it, as follows:</li>\n<li>First: shrinkage on the 66 ra\u1e6dls &mdash; 20 dinars</li>\n<li>Kermes (qirmiz) for dyeing &mdash; 85 dinars</li>\n<li>All further expenses for it &mdash; 25 dinars</li>\n<li>Wages of the [three] dyers &mdash; 20 dinars</li>\n<li>Dyeing in black and green &mdash; 24 dinars</li>\n<li>That subtotal: 174 dinars</li>\n<li>The two totals combined: 474 dinars</li>\n<li>Net yield of dyed silk: 63 ra\u1e6dls</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "translating"
      ],
      "schema:position": 1
    },
