      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso, left side",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>Weight of the silk I left with my master Ab\u016b</li>\n<li>Is\u1e25\u0101q ibn al-Iskandar\u0101n\u012b &mdash; may God preserve him:</li>\n<li>17 ra\u1e6dls [notation unclear]</li></ol>\n",
